    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.surround\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nWhen trying to capture a `div` tag with mini.surround\nit's first `body` parent is captured instead.\n\n### Reproduction\n\nWith the cursor inside the first `div` of this html content...\n\n```html\n<html>\n  <body>\n    <div>\n      some text\n      <div>B</div>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n```\ntry to highlight the tag with`sht`.\nThe `<body>` tag is highlighted.\n\n<img width=\"322\" height=\"274\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20c1b86e-9274-486a-9959-c71e6d573af4\" />",
    "closed_at": "2025-10-18T11:49:32Z",
